      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON TOLHURST (1) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at Capalaba in a handy 20.02 beating Saif. Expected to go well again. BALMAIN BOY (8) drawn the outside box and could get a clear run. Was below best last time when 8th and beaten 13 lengths at this track (35.94). Goes very well at course and distance boasting zero wins. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. BILLY ABLAZE (2) is a safe beginner. Latest effort finished 4th on November 14 over 520m at this track behind Gypsy Girl Pearl beaten 11 lengths (30.67) in a Grade 5. Can feature with the right run. IDEA'S MAN (6) should be thereabouts.",
